    },
    "—" : {
      "comment" : "A placeholder text that is displayed when a value is not available.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "**Chaining targets.** Tap the **Fly** button — labeled with the name of the target with the next-soonest TOT in your list — to jump straight to it, skipping the setup steps. This lets you fly back-to-back passes — set up several targets with sequential TOTs ahead of time, then chain them in flight with a single tap after each pass. Tap **Choose next target** to return to the target list and pick a different one." : {

    },
