    "After the Pass" : {

    },
    "Any time you’ve passed the IP inbound, the CDI switches to target guidance along the IP-to-target bearing. The **red arrow** points to the _desired track_ to the target (not direct-to the target). The **inset portion** of the arrow indicates how far left or right of the desired track you are. The **yellow chevron** with an inset “IP” indicates the direct course to the IP, for situational awareness." : {

    },
