      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Next, define your **initial point (IP)**. This is the position where you will start your run-in to target. It’s used to help ensure you achieve your desired IP-to-target bearing with sufficient time to reach the TP by TOT." : {

    },
