    "On time" : {
      "comment" : "A label displayed in the speed deviation legend.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Once airborne, prior to reaching the IP, IP Inbound displays a **course deviation indicator (CDI)** providing **direct-to guidance** to your IP. The CDI is based on your ground track and magnetic heading. The title reads **P.POS → IP** to remind you that course guidance is to the IP, not the target." : {

    },
    "Once you’ve flown past the target at or after TOT, IP Inbound shows a **post-pass summary** with how the run went — how many seconds early or late you were against your planned TOT, colored on the same scale as the in-flight speed deviation indicator." : {

    },
