      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Targets" : {
      "comment" : "A label for the list of targets.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The **yellow arrow** points directly at the IP. The **red chevron** with an inset “T” indicates the direction to the target, for situational awareness. Below the CDI is the **speed deviation indication**, which indicates whether you need to slow down or speed up to make your time over IP." : {

    },
    "The speed deviation indicator now provides speed guidance to get you over the target at exactly the TOT. The title now reads **IP → Target**, as the CDI is now providing guidance to target along the IP-to-target bearing." : {

