    "When you’re on the ground, prior to takeoff, IP Inbound simply gives you a countdown timer so you can maintain awareness on your approaching TOT. The fun begins when you get airborne." : {

    },
    "Your ground speed, the distance to the IP, and the calculated time over IP are shown at the bottom. Tap the distance or speed to cycle between knots, MPH, or KPH, and tap the TOT to toggle between local and Zulu time (GMT)." : {

